# Wandering Souls (outlands 161) against Rhapsodies of Zilart 5 at the Cape Teriggan headstone. main: the mission
# current, the Wind Fragment held, the quest accepted (GMs: the mission's 201): the mission answers nil (the quest not
# completed): the quest's MUST_BE_A_WAY_TO_SOOTHE; a Rain Lily: 202, finished: completed, the lily taken; the headstone:
# the mission's ALREADY_OBTAINED_FRAG and noAction. bob: the mission completed (its rD ZILART_MONUMENT), the quest
# accepted: the quest's message (50) beats the rD (20).
lists CapeTeriggan/Cermet_Headstone/onTrigger CapeTeriggan/Cermet_Headstone/onTrade CapeTeriggan/onEventFinish/202
char zone=CapeTeriggan pos=-108.084,-8.841,453.989 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=CapeTeriggan pos=-108.084,-8.841,453.989 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Zilart HeadstonePilgrimage current
keyitem WindFragment
quest Outlands.WanderingSouls accepted
item RainLily
bob: mission Zilart HeadstonePilgrimage completed
bob: quest Outlands.WanderingSouls accepted
login
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # the mission: nil; the quest: MUST_BE_A_WAY_TO_SOOTHE
trade Cermet_Headstone RainLily x1      # 202
finish                                  # completed; the lily taken
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # the mission: ALREADY_OBTAINED_FRAG, noAction
bob: login
bob: trigger Cermet_Headstone           # the quest's MUST_BE_A_WAY_TO_SOOTHE over the mission's rD ZILART_MONUMENT
